{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65427,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5f66668b97e4c9fec6362229c8f3ed1e","RawContent":"Do not use Debra Gullette of \"Designer Destination Wedding planners.\" She is unethical and will take your money without doing the work. She charges 3500 to 4000 to work w the vendors in other countries and then complained about having to make phone calls over seas. I lost my wedding date because she failed to pay the deposit on time. She lies to the people at th resort to get discounts and your stuck w the bill when they dicover the truth. When I finally had enough of the games and found another planner travel agent, I. Told her about my experience with Debra and she knew who I was speaking of before I ever mentioned Debra&#039;s name. My new planner ssays that she has received numerous brides that have had similar experiences with Debra. I regret that I fell for her charming personality and didn&#039;t do my research to uncover her repuation in the industry. Do ur research before falliing victim to the charm of a horrible wedding planner.","Attachments":[],"Id":1571358,"PostDate":1327170991,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Do not use Debra Gullette of \"Designer Destination Wedding planners.\" She is unethical and will take your money without doing the work. She charges 3500 to 4000 to work w the vendors in other countries and then complained about having to make phone calls over seas. I lost my wedding date because she failed to pay the deposit on time. She lies to the people at th resort to get discounts and your stuck w the bill when they dicover the truth. When I finally had enough of the games and found another planner travel agent, I. Told her about my experience with Debra and she knew who I was speaking of before I ever mentioned Debra's name. My new planner ssays that she has received numerous brides that have had similar experiences with Debra. I regret that I fell for her charming personality and didn't do my research to uncover her repuation in the industry. Do ur research before falliing victim to the charm of a horrible wedding planner.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Lorristeen@ymail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1326636302,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249932.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsK2012","Id":249932,"Name":"MrsK2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65427,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d9b4f6e00e655d5b69d37f29cb7a064c","RawContent":"So sorry that happened to you! Hope other brides see this info and steer clear!","Attachments":[],"Id":1659873,"PostDate":1346772056,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So sorry that happened to you! Hope other brides see this info and steer clear!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Enjoythepartykm@aol.com","IpAddress":"68.13.213.79","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1343379180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258455.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tulumbride2013","Id":258455,"Name":"Tulumbride2013","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65427,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"31be2640f5755c797e561a6dde8e8d5a","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]MrsK2012[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Do not use Debra Gullette of \"Designer Destination Wedding planners.\" She is unethical and will take your money without doing the work. She charges 3500 to 4000 to work w the vendors in other countries and then complained about having to make phone calls over seas. I lost my wedding date because she failed to pay the deposit on time. She lies to the people at th resort to get discounts and your stuck w the bill when they dicover the truth. When I finally had enough of the games and found another planner travel agent, I. Told her about my experience with Debra and she knew who I was speaking of before I ever mentioned Debra&#039;s name. My new planner ssays that she has received numerous brides that have had similar experiences with Debra. I regret that I fell for her charming personality and didn&#039;t do my research to uncover her repuation in the industry. Do ur research before falliing victim to the charm of a horrible wedding planner.[\/quote] \n Hello MrsK2012, \n \n As a Wedding planner in the Riviera Maya, I am so sorry to hear what you have been through, no bride deserves this.  Wishing you a smooth planning and I am sure you will have a gorgeous wedding. \n \n Happy Happy Planning. \n Joyce","Attachments":[],"Id":1660023,"PostDate":1346793391,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>MrsK2012<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Do not use Debra Gullette of \"Designer Destination Wedding planners.\" She is unethical and will take your money without doing the work. She charges 3500 to 4000 to work w the vendors in other countries and then complained about having to make phone calls over seas. I lost my wedding date because she failed to pay the deposit on time. She lies to the people at th resort to get discounts and your stuck w the bill when they dicover the truth. When I finally had enough of the games and found another planner travel agent, I. Told her about my experience with Debra and she knew who I was speaking of before I ever mentioned Debra's name. My new planner ssays that she has received numerous brides that have had similar experiences with Debra. I regret that I fell for her charming personality and didn't do my research to uncover her repuation in the industry. Do ur research before falliing victim to the charm of a horrible wedding planner.<\/blockquote> <p> Hello MrsK2012,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> As a Wedding planner in the Riviera Maya, I am so sorry to hear what you have been through, no bride deserves this. \u00a0Wishing you a smooth planning and I am sure you will have a gorgeous wedding.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Happy Happy Planning.<\/p> <p> Joyce<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection!<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(40,40,40)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html'>http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(40,40,40)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(40,40,40)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326839987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.211.8.197","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65427,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ec016f2599e0356084ec74a060931a68","RawContent":"So sorry to hear about your experience. Thank you for positing this informmation to raise awareness","Attachments":[],"Id":1865125,"PostDate":1407445183,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So sorry to hear about your experience. Thank you for positing this informmation to raise awareness\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tammy.jacobs@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.211.99.179","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405943365,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279107.jpg?_r=1408932832","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"projecttwayne2015","Id":279107,"Name":"projecttwayne2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"212.87.168.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65427,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b5b2ff051c0f744faf29e55ade7206c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;It is unfortunate that this has happened to you. Hopefully, this is not spoil your party&amp;nbsp;and thanks for the warning&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904699,"PostDate":1442249642,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>It is unfortunate that this has happened to you. Hopefully, this is not spoil your party\u00a0and thanks for the warning<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span><span style=\"font-size:14.6667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\">Happy to be one of <\/span><span style=\"font-size:14.6667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='poptop.uk.com'>Poptop<\/a> suppliers and freelance event planners <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n","Email":"websveta.mat@gmail.com","IpAddress":"212.87.168.22","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442158658,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Svitlana","Id":284800,"Name":"Svitlana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"103.21.185.215","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65427,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"69329d972514d4c103ad36cc5f0ede3b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"MrsK2012\"] So sorry to hear about all of this. My feelings are with you. Same thing is about to happen to me, but my friend saved me from all of this somehow. I and my fianc\u00e9 was looking for wedding destination wedding planner and met around 6-7 approx and accidently one day I received a call from someone saying that he got my number from someone which we met and agreed to do all things with-in our budget, which we were negotiating from long time, and also can book the wedding venue of our choice which was not available earlier and then without looking here and there we booked him for our wedding. I discussed all this with my close friend and where she discussed with me their previous blunders and advised me don\u2019t book them as he is a liar and will never keep his promises and your D-day will be ruined if you go with him, she saved me from taking wrong step and suggested &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.fnpweddings.com\/wedding-planners\/&#039;&gt;FNP Wedding Planners&lt;\/a&gt; which she hired for her wedding as well. They have 20 years of experience in wedding planning, wedding decorations and destination weddings. My wedding was successful and many of close friend recall memories whenever we meet now-a-days.   &lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906742,"PostDate":1445585008,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"249932\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/249932-mrsk2012\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MrsK2012<\/span><\/a> So sorry to hear about all of this. My feelings are with you. Same thing is about to happen to me, but my friend saved me from all of this somehow. I and my fianc\u00e9 was looking for wedding destination wedding planner and met around 6-7 approx and accidently one day I received a call from someone saying that he got my number from someone which we met and agreed to do all things with-in our budget, which we were negotiating from long time, and also can book the wedding venue of our choice which was not available earlier and then without looking here and there we booked him for our wedding. I discussed all this with my close friend and where she discussed with me their previous blunders and advised me don\u2019t book them as he is a liar and will never keep his promises and your D-day will be ruined if you go with him, she saved me from taking wrong step and suggested <a href='http:\/\/www.fnpweddings.com\/wedding-planners\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>FNP Wedding Planners<\/a> which she hired for her wedding as well. They have 20 years of experience in wedding planning, wedding decorations and destination weddings. My wedding was successful and many of close friend recall memories whenever we meet now-a-days. \u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ahujaswati1989@gmail.com","IpAddress":"103.253.175.158","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1445393826,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"swatiahuja","Id":285142,"Name":"swatiahuja","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":6,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}